# Smart Campus Attendance Management System

A secure, role-based, database-driven college/polytechnic attendance and academic management system built for diploma final-year projects.

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React + Vite + Tailwind-inspired CSS
- Backend: Node.js + Express + Prisma ORM
- Database: SQLite (production-ready structure, easy to migrate to PostgreSQL/MySQL)
- Auth: JWT + bcrypt
- File handling: multer

## Features
- Teacher and student roles with secure authentication
- Subject creation and management with unique subject codes
- Student enrollment requests with approval workflow
- Attendance marking and reporting
- Assignment and project management
- Notifications, dashboard analytics, and reports
- Responsive SaaS-style UI

