## Frontend Setup

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend
npm install
npx prisma generate
npx prisma db push
npm run seed
npm run dev
```

## Demo Accounts

- Teacher: `teacher@smartcampus.com` / `Teacher@123`
- Student: `student@smartcampus.com` / `Student@123`

## Security Notes
- Password hashing with bcrypt
- JWT protected routes
- Backend authorization checks for teacher and student data
- SQL injection protection via Prisma
- Input validation and user ownership checks

